       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ROLLING-HAMILTON.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ROLLING-HAMILTON-PROOFS.
           05  WS-EULER-LAGRANGE-NONHOLONOM PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HAMILTONIAN-PHASE-ORBIT  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-POISSON-BRACKET-INVAR    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DISSIPATION-RAYLEIGH-MIN PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ROLLING-PHASE-SPACE-SEAL PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-HAMILTON-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-HAMILTON-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-HAMILTON-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-LAGRANGE-AND-PHASE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-POISSON-AND-RAYLEIGH.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-HAMILTON-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-LAGRANGE-AND-PHASE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EULER-LAGRANGE-NONHOLONOM.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HAMILTONIAN-PHASE-ORBIT.
       2000-EVALUATE-POISSON-AND-RAYLEIGH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-POISSON-BRACKET-INVAR.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DISSIPATION-RAYLEIGH-MIN.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-HAMILTON-PROOFS.
           IF WS-EULER-LAGRANGE-NONHOLONOM = 1 AND
              WS-HAMILTONIAN-PHASE-ORBIT = 1 AND
              WS-POISSON-BRACKET-INVAR = 1 AND
              WS-DISSIPATION-RAYLEIGH-MIN = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ROLLING-PHASE-SPACE-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-HAMILTON-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-HAMILTON-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-HAMILTON-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-HAMILTON-CODE.
